00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.830
Pan- pan- pan...

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.400
All right, time to pack.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:23.660
Wait, wait just a second.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:26.010
Right now you're completely--

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:35.600
Yui, what in the world are you...?!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.980
It's human nature.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.940
